<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:15.720" end="00:00:17.740" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.960" end="00:00:22.980" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.200" end="00:00:27.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t believe it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.510" end="00:00:29.530" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.800" end="00:00:35.900" style="s2">But I don&#39;t have beautiful clothes to</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.200" end="00:00:35.900" style="s2">wear to the ball.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.990" end="00:00:40.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.575" end="00:00:44.595" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.125" end="00:00:51.145" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.710" end="00:00:55.730" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.300" end="00:01:03.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go quickly now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.200" end="00:01:06.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.800" end="00:01:06.800" style="s2">Thank you for everything.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.945" end="00:01:19.965" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.800" end="00:01:27.500" style="s2">Are we near the palace yet?</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.200" end="00:01:27.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just beyond this forest, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.700" end="00:01:40.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.800" end="00:01:40.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think someone is hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.200" end="00:01:48.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened to you? Can I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.100" end="00:01:50.041" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t think I can keep walking.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.600" end="00:01:50.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.041" end="00:01:52.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.500" end="00:01:54.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To the palace.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.700" end="00:01:57.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going there too. I&#39;ll let you ride</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.500" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">with me. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.000" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">You are very kind. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.092" end="00:02:14.492" style="s2">Why were you walking alone in the</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.992" end="00:02:15.692" style="s2">forest? I wanted to go to the palace for</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.492" end="00:02:16.692" style="s2">the ball, but my mother would not let</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.692" end="00:02:17.892" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.692" end="00:02:20.192" style="s2">Why not?</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.892" end="00:02:22.792" style="s2">My mother said I do not belong here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.192" end="00:02:22.792" style="s2">What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.236" end="00:02:39.092" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.192" end="00:02:39.092" style="s2">Let&#39;s go inside.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.292" end="00:02:46.992" style="s2">Where did she go?</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.611" end="00:02:53.631" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.851" end="00:02:58.871" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.092" end="00:03:04.112" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.297" end="00:03:11.317" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.392" end="00:03:15.792" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.792" end="00:03:16.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is your name?</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.792" end="00:03:18.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.992" end="00:03:18.492" style="s2">And what is your name?</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.467" end="00:03:19.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.492" end="00:03:22.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Edward.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.992" end="00:03:22.792" style="s2">Would you dance with me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.362" end="00:03:26.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.602" end="00:03:31.622" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.497" end="00:03:37.517" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.737" end="00:03:42.757" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.692" end="00:03:56.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goodbye. I&#39;ll see you again next time.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.592" end="00:03:56.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.937" end="00:04:08.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.694" end="00:04:12.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will find you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.653" end="00:04:43.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.094" end="00:04:45.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.594" end="00:04:45.794" style="s2">I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.494" end="00:04:51.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you walking?</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.294" end="00:04:52.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a long story.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.794" end="00:04:55.194" style="s2">Right now I don&#39;t even know how to get</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.894" end="00:04:55.194" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.294" end="00:04:57.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me help you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.233" end="00:05:07.253" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.783" end="00:05:13.803" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.494" end="00:05:18.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are we going?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.694" end="00:05:22.494" style="s2">This is my home.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.193" end="00:05:28.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.894" end="00:05:38.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. OPEN THE DOOR.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.894" end="00:05:41.594" style="s2">WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.194" end="00:05:41.594" style="s2">WHY ARE YOU LOCKING ME IN HERE?</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.094" end="00:05:53.794" style="s2">NO. SCRATCHING.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.294" end="00:05:53.794" style="s2">LET ME OUT. OPEN THE DOOR.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.599" end="00:06:01.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.694" end="00:06:06.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BE QUIET AND LIVE HERE FOR THE REST OF</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.295" end="00:06:06.895" style="s2">YOUR LIFE.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.895" end="00:06:14.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.295" end="00:06:14.295" style="s2">Please let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.895" end="00:06:20.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be quiet</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.595" end="00:06:20.595" style="s2">or I will kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.834" end="00:06:25.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.279" end="00:06:38.299" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.684" end="00:07:11.704" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.595" end="00:07:17.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.995" end="00:07:20.595" style="s2">Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.795" end="00:07:25.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Behave yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.695" end="00:07:25.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MY SLIPPER.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.715" end="00:07:28.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.125" end="00:07:44.400" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.435" end="00:07:45.195" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.400" end="00:07:49.395" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.195" end="00:07:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FROM NOW ON IT BELONGS TO ME.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.295" end="00:07:52.315" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.395" end="00:08:05.415" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.290" end="00:08:11.310" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.697" end="00:08:28.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; spirits to spirits to spirits to spirits</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.097" end="00:08:31.097" style="s2">to spirits</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.197" end="00:08:33.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think spirits slips into</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.097" end="00:08:35.545" style="s2">is yet to come.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.525" end="00:08:35.545" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.097" end="00:08:46.597" style="s2">as well</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.297" end="00:08:49.397" style="s2">can</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.136" end="00:09:16.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.721" end="00:09:20.741" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.397" end="00:09:32.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.297" end="00:09:38.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.597" end="00:09:42.397" style="s2">You really are the girl I was searching</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.097" end="00:09:44.921" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.397" end="00:09:46.941" style="s2">She will be my future wife.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.921" end="00:09:46.941" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.597" end="00:09:59.397" style="s2">Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.597" end="00:10:01.697" style="s2">I&#39;ll see you again soon.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.397" end="00:10:01.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.811" end="00:10:11.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.707" end="00:10:17.727" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.527" end="00:10:46.547" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.072" end="00:11:13.598" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.898" end="00:11:13.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.698" end="00:11:54.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave us.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.798" end="00:12:00.298" style="s2">Prince Jash.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.498" end="00:12:00.298" style="s2">Hunt the vessels.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.508" end="00:12:02.528" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.998" end="00:12:10.298" style="s2">Got the net widened around?</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.598" end="00:12:10.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, your Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.813" end="00:12:22.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.499" end="00:12:29.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m safe.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.699" end="00:12:33.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GOOD NIGHT, SEX.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.078" end="00:13:04.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.974" end="00:13:10.899" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.499" end="00:13:10.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT ONE.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.699" end="00:13:22.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT IS TRULY BEAUTIFUL.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.099" end="00:13:22.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.864" end="00:13:34.884" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.034" end="00:13:44.054" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.099" end="00:13:52.999" style="s2">Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.499" end="00:13:52.999" style="s2">Help me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.399" end="00:14:02.099" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.024" end="00:14:22.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.101" end="00:14:31.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Icey Houted.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.401" end="00:14:34.201" style="s2">You [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.301" end="00:14:50.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now, writer, go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.901" end="00:15:02.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.665" end="00:15:19.685" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.765" end="00:15:32.785" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.280" end="00:15:41.300" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.105" end="00:15:51.125" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.690" end="00:15:55.710" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.931" end="00:16:00.951" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.601" end="00:16:08.001" style="s2">Oh, get it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.261" end="00:16:57.281" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.302" end="00:17:22.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From hidden thought and silent mind,</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.002" end="00:17:22.402" style="s2">show me the truth you hold inside.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.602" end="00:17:43.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I fall asleep?</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.902" end="00:17:43.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.247" end="00:17:54.267" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.072" end="00:18:04.092" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.172" end="00:18:17.192" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.032" end="00:18:25.052" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.927" end="00:18:30.947" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.512" end="00:18:35.532" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.752" end="00:18:40.772" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.003" end="00:18:51.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is a fake.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.603" end="00:18:53.703" style="s2">I am the true owner of those slippers.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.803" end="00:18:54.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is only a mad girl. Do not pay</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.703" end="00:18:56.303" style="s2">attention to her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.803" end="00:18:59.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is a witch.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.303" end="00:18:59.303" style="s2">DO NOT BELIEVE HER.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.503" end="00:19:13.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.088" end="00:19:18.108" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.003" end="00:19:22.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOW ARE THESE HERE?</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.003" end="00:19:24.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE stole them from me. She is a thief.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.703" end="00:19:26.403" style="s2">That mad girl stole them.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.903" end="00:19:28.503" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.403" end="00:19:31.903" style="s2">I am telling</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.503" end="00:19:36.203" style="s2">Please believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.903" end="00:19:36.203" style="s2">You mad girl. Take her away.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.008" end="00:20:00.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.103" end="00:20:04.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you all right?</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.503" end="00:20:07.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His eyes snap open. His confusion</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.903" end="00:20:09.403" style="s2">hardening into cold hard certainty.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.003" end="00:20:12.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seize her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.403" end="00:20:14.603" style="s2">She is lying. I AM YOUR WIFE.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.803" end="00:20:16.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I REMEMBER everything now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.603" end="00:20:20.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.703" end="00:20:20.303" style="s2">But you will not escape me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.209" end="00:20:26.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.105" end="00:20:32.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.894" end="00:20:43.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.269" end="00:21:00.289" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.805" end="00:21:17.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you will not marry me, then I will</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.305" end="00:21:19.939" style="s2">kill you both.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.919" end="00:21:19.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.905" end="00:21:38.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.605" end="00:21:40.244" style="s2">His voice breaking choked.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.224" end="00:21:40.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.015" end="00:21:52.035" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.145" end="00:22:22.165" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.806" end="00:22:54.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.106" end="00:22:54.806" style="s2">Clara, wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.906" end="00:23:00.506" style="s2">Clara?</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.106" end="00:23:02.906" style="s2">His voice a desperate whisper.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.506" end="00:23:02.906" style="s2">Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.506" end="00:23:07.806" style="s2">HELP!</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.006" end="00:23:07.806" style="s2">SOMEONE HELP HER!</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.615" end="00:23:10.606" style="s2">[sighs and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.270" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.606" end="00:23:14.506" style="s2">IS SHE ALIVE?</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.906" end="00:23:17.306" style="s2">SHE IS ALIVE</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.506" end="00:23:17.306" style="s2">but very weak.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.786" end="00:23:19.806" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.406" end="00:23:22.426" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.706" end="00:23:42.906" style="s2">How are you feeling?</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.406" end="00:23:44.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am better.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.906" end="00:23:45.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.506" end="00:23:48.406" style="s2">When you are fully well, we will have</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.906" end="00:23:48.406" style="s2">our wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.206" end="00:23:55.906" style="s2">These belong to you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.016" end="00:24:03.036" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.406" end="00:24:17.306" style="s2">They were always [music] yours.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.976" end="00:24:23.996" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.216" end="00:24:29.236" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.766" end="00:24:37.752" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.731" end="00:24:37.752" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.207" end="00:24:45.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh!</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
